{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>今日（21日）下午3時許，警方接報北角發生交通意外，涉及一輛私家車及一名女途人。據報私家車當時沿福蔭道行駛，右轉入宏安道時，撞到一名過路女子。女途人的腳部被困車底，疑一度昏迷，其後恢復清醒，送往東區醫院治理。現場消息指，女途人年約70歲；地下留有血迹。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T09:23:54.791833+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":126,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T08:19:16+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T09:17:27.676054+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T09:17:27.676054+00:00","content_hash":"caca1c5ee439e192570c7efe378193ba9a24785893e3de408c5c6bdc0675042a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}